$ no-mistakes eval --help
[33mA new version of no-mistakes is available: 1.100.1+fleet.r10.1 -> v1.106.1
Run "no-mistakes update" to update[0m
Inspect automatically collected review cases, capture runs on demand, ingest confirmed post-PR misses as false-negative gold, and compare agent candidates pinned to an explicit model and reasoning effort. Eval never starts or uses the shared daemon.

Usage:
  no-mistakes eval [command]

Available Commands:
  capture     Capture every review pass from a run into local cases
  miss        Ingest confirmed post-PR review misses as false-negative gold
  relabel     Refresh gold labels when a source PR has merged after capture
  report      Report local true-positive / false-negative scores, tokens, and cost
  run         Replay captured review passes and score findings against gold
  sets        Inspect local case-set size, finding-level gold, and composition

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for eval

Use "no-mistakes eval [command] --help" for more information about a command.

